{"bendscript":"0.1","blocks":[{"id":"blk-55218","kind":"heading","level":1,"spans":[{"id":"spn-81498","text":"Agentelic — Implementation Build Prompt"}]},{"id":"blk-55219","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-81499","marks":["bold"],"text":"Version:"},{"id":"spn-81500","text":" 1.0 | "},{"id":"spn-81501","marks":["bold"],"text":"Date:"},{"id":"spn-81502","text":" April 2026 | "},{"id":"spn-81503","marks":["bold"],"text":"Type:"},{"id":"spn-81504","text":" Full Implementation (Build Pipeline + MCP + Supabase)"}]},{"id":"blk-55220","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-81505","text":"Your Mission"}]},{"id":"blk-55221","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-81506","text":"You are building "},{"id":"spn-81507","marks":["bold"],"text":"Agentelic"},{"id":"spn-81508","text":" — the engineering layer of the [&] Protocol dark factory pipeline. Agentelic takes SpecPrompt specifications as input and produces tested, deployable agent artifacts through a deterministic 4-stage pipeline with template-based code generation."}]},{"id":"blk-55222","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-81509","marks":["bold"],"text":"Read `docs/spec/README.md` fully before writing a single line."},{"id":"spn-81510","text":" It is the authoritative spec."}]},{"id":"blk-55223","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-81511","text":"Agentelic is the "},{"id":"spn-81512","marks":["bold"],"text":"build stage"},{"id":"spn-81513","text":" of the dark factory pipeline:"}]},{"id":"blk-55224","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"SpecPrompt (spec in) → Agentelic (build) → OS-008 (enforce) → FleetPrompt (distribute) → RuneFort (observe)"},{"id":"blk-55225","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-81514","text":"Target Stack"}]},{"id":"blk-55226","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"Language:   Elixir 1.17+ / OTP 27\nPipeline:   4-stage build (PARSE → TEST INTAKE → GENERATE → COMPILE/TEST)\nMCP:        JSON-RPC over HTTP (agent_create, agent_build, agent_test, agent_deploy,\n            agent_status, template_list, template_pin, spec_validate, test_explain)\nDatabase:   PostgreSQL via shared Supabase (agentelic.* schema, migration range 080-089)\nAuth:       Supabase Auth (shared [&] ecosystem — amp.profiles, amp.workspaces)\nTesting:    ExUnit + deterministic test DSL from spec acceptance criteria\nDeploy:     Fly.io (MCP server + build pipeline worker)"},{"id":"blk-55227","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-81515","text":"Repository Structure"}]},{"id":"blk-55228","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-81516","text":"Create this structure inside "},{"id":"spn-81517","marks":["code"],"text":"agentelic.com/"},{"id":"spn-81518","text":":"}]},{"id":"blk-55229","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"agentelic.com/\n├── lib/\n│   ├── agentelic/\n│   │   ├── agents/\n│   │   │   └── agent.ex              # Agentelic.Agents.Agent Ecto schema (section 4.4.1)\n│   │   ├── builds/\n│   │   │   └── build.ex              # Agentelic.Builds.Build Ecto schema (section 4.4.2)\n│   │   ├── testing/\n│   │   │   ├── test_run.ex           # Agentelic.Testing.TestRun schema (section 4.4.3)\n│   │   │   ├── test_result.ex        # Agentelic.Testing.TestResult embedded schema\n│   │   │   ├── dsl.ex                # Agentelic.Test.DSL — test case generation from specs\n│   │   │   ├── runner.ex             # Agentelic.Testing.Runner — execute tests with mocks\n│   │   │   └── compiled_intake.ex    # Agentelic.Testing.CompiledIntake — SpecPrompt test bridge\n│   │   ├── deploy/\n│   │   │   └── deployment.ex         # Agentelic.Deploy.Deployment schema (section 4.4.4)\n│   │   ├── pipeline/\n│   │   │   ├── orchestrator.ex       # Agentelic.Pipeline.Orchestrator — 4-stage pipeline runner\n│   │   │   ├── parser.ex             # Stage 1: PARSE — SpecPrompt.Spec parsing\n│   │   │   ├── test_intake.ex        # Stage 1.5: TEST INTAKE — compiled test loading\n│   │   │   ├── generator.ex          # Stage 2: GENERATE — template-based code generation\n│   │   │   ├── compiler.ex           # Stage 3: COMPILE — build artifact\n│   │   │   └── tester.ex             # Stage 4: TEST — run deterministic tests\n│   │   ├── templates/\n│   │   │   ├── registry.ex           # Agentelic.Templates.Registry — template version management\n│   │   │   ├── manifest.ex           # Agentelic.Templates.Manifest — template manifest schema\n│   │   │   └── renderer.ex           # Agentelic.Templates.Renderer — EEx template expansion\n│   │   ├── triggers/\n│   │   │   ├── supabase_listener.ex  # Listen for spec.specs inserts via Supabase Realtime\n│   │   │   ├── cloudevents.ex        # Accept CloudEvents webhooks\n│   │   │   └── github_webhook.ex     # Accept GitHub push events on SPEC.md changes\n│   │   ├── publisher.ex              # Emit ConsolidationEvent to FleetPrompt on build success\n│   │   └── mcp/\n│   │       ├── server.ex             # MCP JSON-RPC server (section 4.5)\n│   │       └── tools.ex              # Tool definitions and handlers\n│   ├── agentelic.ex                  # Application entry point\n│   └── agentelic_web/\n│       ├── router.ex                 # Phoenix router (API + webhook endpoints)\n│       └── controllers/\n│           ├── pipeline_controller.ex # POST /api/pipeline/trigger, /api/pipeline/github\n│           └── agent_controller.ex   # REST API for agents\n├── test/\n│   ├── pipeline/\n│   │   ├── parser_test.exs\n│   │   ├── generator_test.exs\n│   │   └── tester_test.exs\n│   ├── testing/\n│   │   ├── dsl_test.exs\n│   │   └── compiled_intake_test.exs\n│   ├── templates/\n│   │   └── registry_test.exs\n│   └── fixtures/\n│       ├── customer_support_spec.md  # Customer-support SPEC.md from SpecPrompt section 3.3\n│       └── compiled_tests.json       # Pre-compiled test assertions\n├── priv/\n│   └── templates/                    # Bundled default templates (small set for MVP)\n│       ├── elixir/\n│       │   └── mcp-server/\n│       │       ├── template.json\n│       │       ├── mix.exs.eex\n│       │       └── lib/agent.ex.eex\n│       └── typescript/\n│           └── mcp-server/\n│               ├── template.json\n│               ├── package.json.eex\n│               └── src/agent.ts.eex\n├── mix.exs\n├── Dockerfile\n└── fly.toml"},{"id":"blk-55230","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-81519","text":"Implementation Order"}]},{"id":"blk-55231","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-81520","text":"Phase 0: Foundation (weeks 1-6)"}]},{"id":"blk-55232","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-55234","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-81521","marks":["bold"],"text":"Set up Phoenix project"},{"id":"spn-81522","text":" with Ecto, Supabase config"}]}],"id":"blk-55233","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-55236","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-81523","marks":["bold"],"text":"Implement Ecto schemas"},{"id":"spn-81524","text":" (sections 4.4.1-4.4.4)"}]}],"id":"blk-55235","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":true},{"id":"blk-55237","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-55239","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-81525","marks":["code"],"text":"Agentelic.Agents.Agent"},{"id":"spn-81526","text":" with workspace_id, user_id, product_type, status state machine"}]}],"id":"blk-55238","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-55241","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-81527","marks":["code"],"text":"Agentelic.Builds.Build"},{"id":"spn-81528","text":" with template_version, template_hash, compiled_tests_hash"}]}],"id":"blk-55240","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-55243","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-81529","marks":["code"],"text":"Agentelic.Testing.TestRun"},{"id":"spn-81530","text":" with workspace_id, compiled_tests_hash"}]}],"id":"blk-55242","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-55245","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-81531","marks":["code"],"text":"Agentelic.Deploy.Deployment"},{"id":"spn-81532","text":" with workspace_id, governance_policy_hash, approved_by"}]}],"id":"blk-55244","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","order